= Install Monaspace

GitHub Next superfamily. Not the DevCentr Appearance default.

Same file on every OS. PlayTime binds `cli.install` for tool `monaspace`.

::: playbook [id="install-monaspace" shell="auto"]

::: choose [id="pkg-format" prompt="How should we install Monaspace?" intent="cli.install" tool="monaspace"]
:::

::: step [id="install" intent="cli.install" tool="monaspace" bind="pkg-format" confirm=true]
:::

:::
